'''Amakusa Shiro''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] event. He was added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]] increases his health and decreases the time between attacks. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]].

