==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]], his Normal Form was named "Shiro Amakusa".
*[[wikipedia:Amakusa Shirō|Amakusa Shirō]] was the teenage leader of the [[wikipedia:Shimabara Rebellion|Shimabara Rebellion]]. Though taken captive, executed and beheaded at the age of 17, he was able to say: "I shall return after 100 years and take my revenge!" as his last words before dying.
**After his death, Shirō's head was displayed on a pike in Nagasaki as a warning to Christian rebels, which could explain why Wargod Amakusa's mask is embedded in a sword- or stake-shaped object.

